 about past projects or specific technical challenges I've encountered and overcome. This stage was where I could truly demonstrate my expertise, not just by knowing the answers, but by explaining my thought process, justifying my design choices, and showcasing my approach to debugging and troubleshooting. It was a focused assessment, entirely dedicated to proving my technical readiness for the position.
